   "source": [
    "**Human Movement Intelligence | Presented by: Reza Saadatyar (2026)**\n",
    "\n",
    "**20 | HARTH Output-Based Research Evidence Consolidation**\n",
    "\n",
    "![Stage 20 output-based research workflow](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RezaSaadatyar/human-movement-intelligence/main/wearable_activity_recognition/images/20_workflow.svg)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** Consolidate selected results from previous HARTH stages using their exported CSV files, rather than reading or auditing saved Jupyter notebook cells.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data sources:** Version-controlled or locally generated CSV outputs from Stages 08, 09, 10, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17 and 19 in the shared study output directory. Raw HARTH recordings and model training are not repeated.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Scope:** Validate the required source files and columns, derive cohort sizes, compare scores within their stated evaluation protocols, inspect minority-class sampling, and summarise participant-disjoint calibration results.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research boundaries:** Reported scores are Development evidence, not an independent final-Test estimate. Earlier descriptive examination of S023 and S032 means strict preregistered Test blindness cannot be claimed. This notebook never infers scientific validity from the execution history of other notebooks."
   ]
  },
